			{
				"type": "Comment",
				"start": 0,
				"end": 416,
				"data": "\n\tA declaration tag renders nothing and takes its OWN LINE: `{@const}`, and the\n\t`{const …}` / `{let …}` pair. `clean_nodes` HOISTS it out of its fragment before the\n\twhitespace rules run, so the break beside it is render-free and every authoring\n\tconverges here. Two shapes are excluded: a tag GLUED on both sides (breaking there\n\tWOULD inject a rendered space) and `{@debug}`, whose edge run trims instead.\n"
			},
